    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0814" n="664" xml:id="pg664"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/272.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Nicaragua to President
                        Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua, Nicaragua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-12-22"><hi rendition="#italic">December 22,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I send Your Excellency earnest thanks for important participation you were
                    pleased to take in pacific settlement of Central American differences happily
                    brought to an end.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. S. Zelaya.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
